---
/**
 * Hero atmosphere — drifting aurora color field + cursor-follow glow.
 *
 * Usage: drop inside a hero <section> that has `relative overflow-hidden
 * data-glow`, and keep the hero's real content in a sibling with `relative
 * z-10` so it sits above the backdrop.
 *
 * The cursor-glow tracking is wired globally in BaseLayout for every
 * [data-glow] section, so no per-page script is needed.
 */
---

<div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="aurora__blob aurora__blob--forest"></div>
  <div class="aurora__blob aurora__blob--ember"></div>
  <div class="aurora__blob aurora__blob--signal"></div>
</div>
<div class="cursor-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
